WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.310
Wait, Makio!

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:05.590
Right now, even the Inter-High 
isn't a pipe dream for us.

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:09.320
But I also know that
we won't make it like this.

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.470
<i>I understand how you feel.</i>

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:19.740
You should know what our team needs.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:23.580
<i>Right now, what the soccer team needs...</i>

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:24.630
<i>...is a training camp.</i>

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.780
<i>Next time, on </i>Soccer Boyfriend<i>:</i>

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:29.380
Soccer

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:29.380
Boyfriend

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:29.380
<b>That's It! Let's go to a training camp!</b>

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:28.260
<i>"That's it! Let's go to a training camp."</i>

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.380
<i>Enjoy!</i>

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:30.520
Happy

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:32.420
That's it! Let's go to a training camp!

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:07.100
<b>#09</b>

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:07.100
<b>Miwa-chan Wants to 
Do a Training Camp</b>

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.600
A training camp?!

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:13.490
A training camp, huh? 
I guess we've never done one.

00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:16.940
There was no point since we were so weak.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:19.860
We've been miraculously lucky
to make it this far.

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:22.870
If we want to turn that miraculous luck
into deserved victories,

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:27.910
we must improve our skills, physical ability,
and mental strength at once.

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:30.590
Then we should just do it
at our summer villa.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:34.220
That's my Kaocchi! You know what's up!

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:35.130
Zaizen.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:39.420
No need to thank me. 
Anything to make our team better.

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:41.350
Can I bring my girlfriend?

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.500
I want to bring my grandma.

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:46.100
I want to bring my dog and parakeet.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:50.250
You guys are ridiculous! Just shut it!

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:51.850
I won't go.

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:53.680
Why not?!

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:56.950
Taking a bath together after practice!

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:59.310
Sleeping in a big pile in the hall!

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:02.330
Having secret pillow fights!

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.940
What could be better than that?!

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:07.120
I don't want any of that.

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:10.910
Damn them all.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:15.060
Welcome home, Daddy. You're back early.

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:16.800
That I am.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:19.050
I heard you're going to a training camp.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:20.880
Y-Yes.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:26.510
You don't have any talent for soccer. 
Going to a training camp is pointless.

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:30.140
You do know what I'm talking about, right?

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:34.550
I'll make the opponents' goal bigger.

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:35.530
Wha?

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:37.900
Then you'll be able to score lots more goals.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:41.900
Hey, call the prime minister. 
We're changing the rules of soccer!

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.660
Are you stupid?

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:47.660
You're coddling Brother far too much, Father.

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:50.780
Karin!

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:54.310
That said, going to Nationals is his dream.

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:56.420
I'll do all I can to help,
though it may not be much.

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:57.850
Karin.

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:05.000
You are so cute! The cutest in 
the world, no, in the universe!

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.090
I'm already in 9th grade!

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:09.060
Fly my angel, fly!

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:09.930
Hey, put me down! Put me down!

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:12.140
I am so overwhelmed!

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:13.450
Hey! S-Stop!

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.140
Karin!

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:15.940
Who are you?

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:17.420
Kaocchi!

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:20.190
Coach? What are you doing here?

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:23.740
I decided to ask for your sister's help.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.240
Documentary
Zaizen Kaoru
&
Aoyama-kun

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.660
What is this?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.890
The other clubs are coming, too?

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:36.100
I invited them.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:41.260
I also arranged for a pro camera crew to
record you have the time of your life.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:42.870
Where's Narita?

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:44.260
Who knows.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.760
There's a limited-time sea quest
in <i>Monstrosity Hunter</i>.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.260
I don't have time for a training camp.

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:50.790
Aoyama-kun isn't here.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:54.120
Taking the bus would be hard for him.

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.380
You're quite close to your neighbor.

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:58.670
He might be taking his bike.

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:00.130
Or not come at all.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.690
Wh-What's happening?!

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:08.280
A-Aoyama?

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.690
What's going on?

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.140
So bright!

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.290
He's cleaned it through and through!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.270
I'm glad you made it, Aoyama.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:20.500
What?

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:23.820
That's...

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:25.300
Fighter jets?

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:30.300
<b>Kaocchi,
you forgot something</b>

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:30.300
Daddy—I mean, old man?

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:34.690
New cleats?

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:36.810
Damn you, Richie Rich!

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:39.420
Thank you, Daddy.

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:44.960
<b>Super Effective Boy's
Cleaning Diaries</b>

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:48.570
<b>I'll be waiting on location. -Dad</b>

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:55.580
I wonder why Aoyama
changed his mind about coming.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:59.220
For the team, of course. 
He knows how important this is.

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:09.460
<i>I'll be spending a night under 
the same roof as Aoyama-kun.</i>

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:17.100
<i>I feel like this is diverging
from the training camp episode,</i>

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.100
<i>but whatever.</i>

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:22.270
<i>Going to a training camp with 
the whole school should be fun.</i>

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:27.610
Whoa!

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:30.440
I was expecting fancy, but...

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.490
This goes beyond my imagination.

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:36.430
Welcome. Let me show you to your rooms.

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:43.000
For Aoyama-sama, we have a single room
with a super potent air purifying machine.

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:46.170
So that's why you came?!

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:51.930
If this is what he gets,
our rooms should be great, too.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:52.830
Yeah.

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:55.700
For the rest of you,
we have a Japanese-style room.

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:57.700
Oh, nice!

00:06:58.270 --> 00:06:59.780
This is it.

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:06.540
K-Karin-chan, is this really it?

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:08.780
What happened to all the class and glamour?

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:14.280
My brother said that you all 
wanted to sleep in a big pile.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:15.970
Zaizen!

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:18.170
Hey, it feels more like
a training camp this way.

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:22.040
I've always dreamed about having
a training camp in this kinda place.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:25.540
I am delighted that one of your 
dreams has come true, Brother.

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:33.290
You're late.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:43.560
<b>Aoyama Life</b>

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:43.560
That's Gotou-chan for you.
Always sticks to her brand.

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:46.700
All right. Split into teams and practice.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.870
What? On the beach?

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:53.450
On the sand, you lack a stable footing,
so it'll train your legs and core.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:58.500
And the Zaizen Group will provide support
with its cutting-edge tech.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:00.080
Master!

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:08.090
Yurippe.

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:13.220
The beach is the best!

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:17.530
They have Aoyama on their side.

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:21.190
Let's just do our best, okay?

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:23.220
You're assuming we're gonna lose?

00:08:23.220 --> 00:08:24.260
I like it.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:29.750
The stronger the opponent,
the better the taste of victory.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:34.610
Victory at all cost! Come on, Team Red!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.350
Fight!

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:38.020
Okay, I'm up for this now!

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:39.870
I feel like we can win!

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:42.120
H-Huh?

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:48.700
<i>Aoyama-kun refused to get in the pool,
but he's okay with the ocean?</i>

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:51.670
Aoyama, what are you doing?

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:54.130
We're starting!

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:00.760
Nice clearance, Umeya!

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:02.420
Not bad.

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:04.260
On the other hand...

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:06.380
Aoyama!

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:07.270
Yes?

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:11.080
Put some slide tackles in or whatever!
Do <i>something</i> to get the ball!

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:12.500
It would get sand on me.

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:14.520
Oh, don't worry about that.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:19.530
This beach has purified sand
with an anti-bacterial coating.

00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:22.000
Well, everybody's been stepping on it.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:24.370
You're saying our feet are dirty?!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:28.010
Are you okay?

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:30.790
I think I twisted my ankle.

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:36.800
Aoyama-kun!

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:32.760
<i>Yurippe!</i>

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:36.800
I ♥ Aoyama

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:35.940
<i>She didn't even notice.</i>

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:38.470
Are you all right?

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:41.310
Please leave this to our sports doctor.

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:44.700
Gotou-chan, do you want 
to go in for Ishikawa?

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:45.610
Huh?

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:46.850
Miwa-chan?

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:50.630
I know you always put in work
by yourself after practice.

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:52.570
<i>She noticed!</i>

00:09:54.270 --> 00:09:57.330
I can play soccer with Aoyama-kun.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:01.270
Want to join Team Red, then?

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:02.580
Yeah.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:08.080
<i>After I joined a different middle school,
I had my parents buy me a soccer ball.</i>

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.860
<i>To make up for not being able to see you,</i>

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:14.340
I ♥ Aoyama

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:14.340
<i>I spent those three years
kicking that ball every day.</i>

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:15.840
Gotou-chan!

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:17.340
Got it!

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:21.590
<i>Going hard on her would be mean.
I should be gentle.</i>

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:28.260
<i>Huh?</i>

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:32.000
She's good!

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.300
A Neymar-esque sombrero flick?!

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.180
However!

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:38.360
You won't get past us!

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.870
Pathetic.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:44.620
I'll stop her!

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:52.490
Hey! Zaizen!

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:54.150
She's a girl!

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:56.060
This is the problem with muscle-heads!

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:58.880
Hey, I didn't touch her!

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:03.700
Malicia? She dove?

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:06.890
Where did she learn such a cunning move?

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.400
One-on-one against Aoyama?

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:21.150
Gotou-chan passed Aoyama!

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:26.910
What? Aoyama slid?!

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:32.420
Is it a foul?

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:35.390
No, Aoyama touched the ball!

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:37.170
It's not a foul.

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:39.170
Leave it to me!

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:44.180
What?

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:46.990
Kaocchi's terrible with his feet.

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:48.930
Terrible with his feet?

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:50.850
Gotou Moka.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:55.940
Stop doing that. I don't like dirty plays.

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.620
I'm sorry.

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:02.570
Your dribbling was good, though.

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:13.750
<i>Soccer comes first for me,
and you come second.</i>

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:16.960
Thank you.

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:18.850
<i>Makio.</i>

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.870
<i>Just now, on the bottom of my foot,</i>

00:12:23.780 --> 00:12:28.470
<i>however slight it might have been,
I felt Aoyama-kun's touch.</i>

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:32.250
Sensei, I'm glad I came to the training camp!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.980
Elegant

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.980
Butler

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.980
Zaizen Daddy

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.980
Zaizen Karin

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.980
Family!

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.980
Takei Miwa

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.980
Loves Shoujo Manga
Third dan in Judo

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.980
<b>Spicy Photo!!</b>

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:45.910
Make sure to warm up properly!

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:50.760
You there! Don't get distracted!

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:55.920
Bend and stretch, put your hands 
on your knees and go round and round.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:59.420
Warming up is the best!

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:02.920
When you've touched the rock that you 
can see in the sea, you come back.

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:06.060
I've always wanted to try
long-distance swimming.

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:07.930
First!

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:24.190
<b>Umeya</b>

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:24.190
<b>Odagiri</b>

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:24.190
<b>Zaizen</b>

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:24.190
<b>Rest</b>

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.540
We've been swimming for a while.

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:28.950
But we're not getting closer at all.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.380
What's going on?

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:33.540
I'll go ahead, then!

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:34.650
Watch out!

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:43.340
A wall?!

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:47.060
I thought it was real, but it's a picture.

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:48.590
Amazing!

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:50.310
So that's a picture, too.

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:53.600
So we've been indoors all this time.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:55.060
Exactly.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:59.460
This is a dome that imitates nature,
tailor-made for Brother's training camp.

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:00.610
<i>Karin!</i>

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:03.580
<i>Using the Zaizen Group's 
proprietary construction methods,</i>

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:06.770
<i>we were able to build a dome 
with a one kilometer diameter.</i>

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:13.180
<i>And by aggressively using solar and other 
renewable energy, we cut costs by 65%.</i>

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:14.890
Costs Reduced By

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:15.080
<b>Patent Acquired</b>

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:15.080
We even got a patent for it.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.690
Even if it's for her brother...

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:19.370
...the scale of it all is out of whack.

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:22.340
The Zaizen Group really is amazing.

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:27.900
Also, to help my brother
overcome his terrible footing,

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:29.670
we have one more contraption.

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:35.690
<i>Please do not worry. The waves are 
localized to where my brother is.</i>

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:39.100
H-Hey!

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:48.170
Give it your best, Brother.

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:51.870
If you overcome this wave,
your footing should become more stable!

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:55.020
Um, when people say that
someone's terrible with their feet,

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:58.870
they actually mean that person
sucks at soccer.

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:03.920
Zaizen-san, in particular, 
simply can't shoot at all.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.170
Impressive.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:07.330
This over-the-top sisterly love.

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.880
Zaizen's got it rough, huh?

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:13.040
I'm so happy!

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:15.610
He seems super satisfied!

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:22.150
So tired.

00:15:22.510 --> 00:15:25.150
After that, there was shooting practice.

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:27.020
Dribbling practice.

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:32.660
We did all sorts of things, 
but I'm too hungry to remember.

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:35.530
So hungry.

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:38.550
It's time to eat.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:41.210
All right!

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.920
If it's Zaizen food, 
it must be really delicious!

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:47.470
Of course.

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:53.430
Please enjoy.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:56.930
A pea?!

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:59.680
K-Karin-sama. Is this some kind of...

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:07.190
This is the ultimate meal, one grain
packed with every nutrient known to man.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:10.700
The fruit of all of Zaizen Group's
research combined,

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:12.220
the jewel in our crown!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:22.770
Th-This is...

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:25.940
It might be nutritious.

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:28.270
But it just doesn't make you feel full.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:35.220
What is this aroma?

00:16:41.970 --> 00:16:44.010
Who are you?!

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:47.010
Jinnai-sensei?

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:58.490
Let us eat!

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:07.140
So full! So good!

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:11.000
What is it?

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:13.830
Time for some recreational fun.

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:16.010
We're holding a test of courage.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:18.620
With just guys?

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:22.330
Sensei, can outsiders participate, too?

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:23.270
Sure.

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:25.020
I ♥ Aoyama

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:27.830
We're all prepared.

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:29.360
If you press this button,

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:33.770
an ultra-powerful super computer that is
the pride and joy of the Zaizen Group

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:39.030
<b>Testing my courage with you</b>

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:39.030
<b>Project lead: Zaizen Karin</b>

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:37.110
will automatically pair people up
and display them here.

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:41.370
K-Karaoke?

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:43.540
Wait, look at that.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:45.780
It's starting to form teams!

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:47.040
Tanaka Riku

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:47.040
Satou Sakura		                  Suzuki Yuuka                   Takahashi Misaki

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:47.040
Nakamura Ren

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:47.040
Kobayashi Moe

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:47.040
Katou Shouta

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:47.040
Nakamura Asuka

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:47.040
Yuuta                      Suzuki Shou

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:47.040
Takahashi Kaito

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:47.040
Katou Manami

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:50.460
I hope I can be paired 
with you and Aoyama-kun.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:53.240
Yes, let's be a pair together with Aoyama.

00:17:53.240 --> 00:17:55.050
That's not a pair. Not happening.

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:57.790
I hope we'll be paired up, Yuu-chan.

00:17:58.810 --> 00:18:02.310
I don't do ghosts, so I'll bail.

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:04.850
Now, then!

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:11.310
<b>Operating Room</b>

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:12.960
Listen up, Aoyama.

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:14.940
Now that we've paired up,

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:20.600
no matter what happens, follow me...

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:21.490
Eek!

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:23.330
U-Until the end!

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.870
H-Hey.

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.280
Will we be okay?

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:40.580
Wow, amazing.

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:43.600
This is really well made.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:45.720
<i>How is she not scared?</i>

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:49.850
Those Hollywood pros they flew in
really did their thing.

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:50.980
Shall we?

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:51.710
Yeah.

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:54.590
<i>I'm so glad I'm paired with Odagiri-san.</i>

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:06.540
<i>I won't let you sully Aoyama-kun!</i>

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:16.380
G-Gotou-chan, swinging around 
a bat like that is dangerous!

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:19.380
I'm starting to have fun.

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:24.850
<b>Nurse Station</b>

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:28.780
The time has come. 
We're going to use this opportunity...

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:32.350
to hug Aoyama-kun!

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.490
Aoyama-kun!

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:50.380
Zaizen-san?

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:55.630
Leave him to me, Moka-chan!
You take care of the ghosts!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:56.630
Got it!

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:58.820
What is it with them?

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:02.370
Aoyama only cares about cleaning,

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:05.050
and Gotou-chan only cares about Aoyama.

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:09.890
Odagiri-chan isn't scared at all,
and Zaizen is too scared.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:13.340
Some test of courage.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.870
I-I finally made it out.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:34.970
Karin!

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:36.330
Brother.

00:20:37.550 --> 00:20:39.450
I've been waiting for you.

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:44.880
Eek!

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:57.850
It's finally clean.

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:02.290
That was fun, right?

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:14.920
Good.

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:30.600
Practice is good, but having fun is the best.

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:35.270
All right! I guess I'll check
my training camp answers now!

00:23:10.850 --> 00:23:12.780
All right!

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:15.050
This is the fruit of our training camp!

00:23:18.850 --> 00:23:20.210
Kurata Kozue!

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:22.370
Did Aoyama just...

00:23:23.830 --> 00:23:26.960
He just yelled, didn't he?

00:23:32.540 --> 00:23:34.850
You seem well, Aoyama.

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:41.500
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:41.500
<b>Aoyama-kun Has Many Secrets</b>
